    339  42db							; ---------------------------------------------------------
    340  42db							; throne: the throne room, each frame of the game. The
    341  42db							; crown on the throne: the blade breaks it, VICTORY
    342  42db							; (CROWN_POINTS, the first byte of the score, and
    343  42db							; ENERGY_POINTS for each unit of energy left). The King:
    344  42db							; - after a blow he flashes for KHIT_FRAMES, and no blow
    345  42db							;   counts; otherwise a blade on him is a blow
    346  42db							;   (KHIT_BCD points), and the KING_HITS-th beats him: the
    347  42db							;   crown takes his place (KING_BCD points), the venom is
    348  42db							;   gone;
    349  42db							; - his bite: their boxes meet and no wound is counting
