    644  74fc							; place: object X (0 player 0, 1 player 1, 2 missile 0, 3
    645  74fc							; missile 1, 4 the ball) at column A: the first pixel of a
    646  74fc							; player is A + 3, of a missile or the ball A + 2. Takes one
    647  74fc							; line: the WSYNC, then 15 pixels per 5 cycles.
    648  74fc							; (its loop in one page: a branch that crosses one takes a
    649  74fc							; cycle more, and the column would be wrong; the padding
    650  74fc							; comes after an rts)
